# Values the tools API hands out to programs in /workspace:
#   GET http://127.0.0.1:7777/config/<KEY>   or   agent-tools config <KEY>
# On the NAS this is ./config/tools.env. Edits apply immediately, no restart needed.
# Anything in /workspace (including Claude) can read these, so only put values here
# that those programs are meant to use.

# EXAMPLE_API_URL=https://example.com/api
